        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Redford- Make the Move\r\n \r\nWelcome to Redford – Your New Beginning in Adamstown\r\n\r\nThe Erin \r\n\r\nA-Rated 3-Bedroom End-of-Terrace Home | 104 sq.m / 1,119 sq.ft | Stylish & Energy Efficient\r\n\r\nWelcome to this beautifully presented A-rated, 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom end-of-terrace home, offering 104 sq.m (1,119 sq.ft) of bright, well-proportioned living space in a highly sought-after residential location.\r\n\r\nSet over two floors, this property is ideal for modern family living, with a thoughtfully designed layout and contemporary finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nInviting, light-filled living room to the front with large window and elegant finishes\r\nSpacious open-plan kitchen with central island, quality cabinetry, and integrated appliances\r\nBright dining area with ample space for entertaining and direct access to the rear garden\r\nSeparate utility room for additional storage and laundry\r\nConvenient guest WC off the main hallway\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nTwo generous double bedrooms, including a main bedroom with sleek ensuite bathroom\r\nOne well-proportioned single bedroom, perfect as a nursery, home office, or guest room\r\nContemporary family bathroom with quality sanitary ware and modern tiling\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nA-rated for energy efficiency – benefiting from high-spec insulation, efficient heating system, and triple-glazed windows\r\nEnd-of-terrace position offering extra privacy and side access\r\nPrivate rear garden ideal for outdoor dining or play\r\nOff-street parking\r\nTurnkey condition throughout\r\n\r\nThis home combines energy efficiency, stylish design, and a practical layout – ideal for families, first-time buyers, or investors. Located close to excellent schools, shops, transport links, and green open spaces, it offers the best of suburban living with all amenities close at hand."
      },
